{"body":"## 1. Project Overview\n- **Project Title:** Voice RAG in Hindi and English: Multilingual Audio Search with Db2 Vectors\n- **Project Slug:** `submissions/db2-multilingual-voice-rag/`\n- **Short Description:** Hindi and English talks are transcribed with Whisper, stored as multilingual embeddings in Db2, and searched in either language. Each result shows the audio file and time range it came from.\n\n## 2. Team Information\n- **Team Name:** Db2 Governed RAG\n- Keshav Maheshwari (@keshav-23), Developer\n\n## 3. IBM Db2 Integration Summary\n- **Environment:** IBM Db2 12.1.2+ (native VECTOR type)\n- **Connector:** `ibm-db-haystack` (`IBMDb2DocumentStore`, `IBMDb2EmbeddingRetriever`) over `ibm_db`\n- **Usage:** `VECTOR(768, FLOAT32)` column, `VECTOR_DISTANCE` (COSINE), JSON metadata (language, source, start, end) stored with each vector\n- **Verify:** see \"Run\" and \"Check the data in Db2\" in the project README\n\n## 4. Technology Stack\n- **Language:** Python\n- **Framework:** Haystack, sentence-transformers, openai-whisper\n- **Models:** Whisper medium (speech to text), multilingual-e5-base (embeddings), Ollama qwen2.5:7b (answers)\n","comments":[],"files":[{"path":"submissions/db2-multilingual-voice-rag/.env.example","additions":11,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/db2-multilingual-voice-rag/README.md","additions":61,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/db2-multilingual-voice-rag/architecture.md","additions":44,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/db2-multilingual-voice-rag/docs/screenshots/.gitkeep","additions":0,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/db2-multilingual-voice-rag/src/audio/talk_en.mp3","additions":0,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/db2-multilingual-voice-rag/src/audio/talk_hi.mp3","additions":0,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/db2-multilingual-voice-rag/src/chunks.py","additions":20,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADD